 Architecture**: Supports large numbers of agents and environments\\n- **Interactive Learning**: Agents can learn through social interactions\\n\\n## Project Information\\n\\n- **Status**: Presented at ICLR 2024 as a spotlight paper \u2b50\\n- **License**: MIT License\\n- **Repository**: http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/sotopia\\n- **Documentation**: https://docs.sotopia.world/\\n\\n### Resources\\n\\n- **Project Page**: https://www.sotopia.world/projects/sotopia\\n- **Paper PDF**: https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.11667\\n- **Dataset**: https://huggingface.co/datasets/cmu-lti/sotopia\\n- **Demo**: https://huggingface.co/spaces/cmu-lti/sotopia-space/\\n- **PyPI**: https://pypi.python.org/pypi/sotopia\\n\\n## Installation\\n\\n### Prerequisites\\n- Python 3.11+\\n- Conda environment\\n- OpenAI API key\\n\\n### Installation Steps\\n\\n1. **Create virtual environment**:\\n   ```bash\\n   conda create -n sotopia python=3.11\\n   conda activate sotopia\\n   curl -sSL https://install.python-poetry.org | python3\\n   ```\\n\\n2. **Install Sotopia**:\\n   ```bash\\n   python -m pip install sotopia\\n   sotopia install\\n   ```\\n\\n3. **Set OpenAI API key**:\\n   ```bash\\n   conda env config vars set OPENAI_API_KEY=your_key\\n   ```\\n\\n> [!TIP]\\n> Having trouble installing? Or don\\'t want to install redis for now? We are working on a public redis server for you to use. Stay tuned!\\n\\n## Quick Start\\n\\n### Easy Sample Server\\n\\nYou can run a demo episode with default parameters:\\n\\n```python\\nimport asyncio\\nfrom sotopia.samplers import UniformSampler\\nfrom sotopia.server import run_async_server\\n\\nasyncio.run(\\n    run_async_server(\\n        model_dict={\\n            \"env\": \"gpt-4\",\\n            \"agent1\": \"gpt-4o-mini\", \\n            \"agent2\": \"gpt-4o-mini\",\\n        },\\n        sampler=UniformSampler(),\\n    )\\n)\\n```\\n\\nOr run the minimalist demo:\\n```bash\\npython examples/minimalist_demo.py\\n```\\n\\n## Code Structure\\n\\nThe 