/snippets) [ Activity ](/dashboard/activity) [ Groups ](/dashboard/groups) [ Projects ](/dashboard/projects) [ Create a new issue ](/root/sotopia/-/issues/new)\\n\\n<::before>\\n\\nTo help improve GitLab, we would like to periodically [ collect usage information ](/help/administration/settings/usage_statistics.md) . This can be changed at any time in [ your settings ](/admin/application_settings/metrics_and_profiling#js-usage-settings) . \\n\\n[ Send service data  ](/admin/application_settings?application_setting%5Busage_ping_enabled%5D=1&application_setting%5Bversion_check_enabled%5D=1) [ Don\\'t send service data  ](/admin/application_settings?application_setting%5Busage_ping_enabled%5D=0&application_setting%5Bversion_check_enabled%5D=0)\\n\\n  1. <::after> [ Administrator  ](/root)\\n  2. <::after> [ sotopia  ](/root/sotopia)\\n  3. <::after> [ Wiki  ](/root/sotopia/-/wikis/home)\\n  4. [ Sotopia: Introduction and Overview  ](/root/sotopia/-/wikis/Sotopia:-Introduction-and-Overview)\\n\\n\\n\\n#  Sotopia: Introduction and Overview \\n\\nEdit \\n\\n* [ New page  ](/root/sotopia/-/wikis/new)\\n* [ Templates  ](/root/sotopia/-/wikis/templates)\\n\\n* Clone repository \\n\\n*   * [ Page history  ](/root/sotopia/-/wikis/Sotopia:-Introduction-and-Overview/history)\\n  * Print as PDF \\n\\n\\n*   * Delete page \\n\\n\\n\\n\\nLast edited by [ Administrator ](http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root)\\n\\n#  <::after> Sotopia: Introduction and Overview \\n\\n##  <::after> What is Sotopia? \\n\\nSotopia is an open-ended social learning environment designed as a platform for evaluating and facilitating social intelligence in language agents. It allows agents to interact with each other and the environment in a scalable, extensible framework. \\n\\n###  <::after> Key Features \\n\\n  * <::marker> **Open-ended Environment** : Easily extendable to include new environments and agents \\n  * <::marker> **Social Intelligence Evaluation** : Platform for assessing social intelligence in language agents \\n  * <::marker> **Scalable Architecture** : Supports large numbers of agents and environments \\n  * <::marker> **Interactive Learning** : Agents can learn through social interactions \\n\\n\\n\\n##  <::after> Project Information \\n\\n  * <::marker> **Status** : Presented at ICLR 2024 as a spotlight paper  \u2b50 \\n  * <::marker> **License** : MIT License \\n  * <::marker> **Repository** : [ http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/sotopia ](http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/sotopia)\\n  * <::marker> **Documentation** : [ https://docs.sotopia.world/ ](https://docs.sotopia.world/)\\n\\n\\n\\n###  <::after> Resources \\n\\n  * <::marker> **Project Page** : [ https://www.sotopia.world/projects/sotopia ](https://www.sotopia.world/projects/sotopia)\\n  * <::marker> **Paper PDF** : [ https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.11667 ](https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.11667)\\n  * <::marker> **Dataset** : [ https://huggingface.co/datasets/cmu-lti/sotopia ](https://huggingface.co/datasets/cmu-lti/sotopia)\\n  * <::marker> **Demo** : [ https://huggingface.co/spaces/cmu-lti/sotopia-space/ ](https://huggingface.co/spaces/cmu-lti/sotopia-space/)\\n  * <::marker> **PyPI** : [ https://pypi.python.org/pypi/sotopia ](https://pypi.python.org/pypi/sotopia)\\n\\n\\n\\n##  <::after> Installation \\n\\n###  <::after> Prerequisites \\n\\n  * <::marker>Python 3.11+ \\n  * <::marker>Conda environment \\n  * <::marker>OpenAI API key \\n\\n\\n\\n###  <::after> Installation Steps \\n\\n  1. <::marker>\\n\\n**Create virtual environment** : \\n         \\n         conda create -n sotopia python=3.11\\n         conda activate sotopia\\n         curl -sSL https://install.python-poetry.org | python3\\n\\n  2. <::marker>\\n\\n**Install Sotopia** : \\n         \\n         python -m pip install sotopia\\n         sotopia install\\n\\n  3. <::marker>\\n\\n**Set OpenAI API key** : \\n         \\n         conda env config vars set OPENAI_API_KEY=your_key\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n> [!TIP] Having trouble installing? Or don\\'t want to install redis for now? We are working on a public redis server for you to use. Stay tuned! \\n\\n##  <::after> Quick Start \\n\\n###  <::after> Easy Sample Server \\n\\nYou can run a demo episode with default parameters: \\n    \\n    \\n    import asyncio\\n    from sotopia.samplers import UniformSampler\\n    from sotopia.server import run_async_server\\n    \\n    asyncio.run(\\n        run_async_server(\\n            model_dict={\\n                \"env\": \"gpt-4\",\\n                \"agent1\": \"gpt-4o-mini\", \\n                \"agent2\": \"gpt-4o-mini\",\\n            },\\n            sampler=UniformSampler(),\\n        )\\n    )\\n\\nOr run the minimalist demo: \\n    \\n    \\n    python examples/minimalist_demo.py\\n\\n##  <::after> Code Structure \\n\\nThe repository contains several key directories: \\n\\n  * <::marker> ` sotopia/ ` \\\\- Main package code \\n  * <::marker> ` sotopia-chat/ ` \\\\- Chat-related functionality \\n  * <::marker> ` examples/ ` \\\\- Usage examples and demos \\n  * <::marker> ` notebooks/ ` \\\\- Jupyter notebooks \\n  * <::marker> ` tests/ ` \\\\- Test suite \\n  * <::marker> ` docs/ ` \\\\- Documentation \\n  * <::marker> ` scripts/ ` \\\\- Utility scripts \\n\\n\\n\\n##  <::after> Citation \\n\\nIf you use Sotopia in your research, please cite: \\n    \\n    \\n    @inproceedings{zhou2024sotopia,\\n      title={SOTOPIA: Interactive Evaluation for Social Intelligence in Language Agents},\\n      author={Zhou*, Xuhui and Zhu*, Hao and Mathur, Leena and Zhang, Ruohong and Qi, Zhengyang and Yu, Haofei and Morency, Louis-Philippe and Bisk, Yonatan and Fried, Daniel and Neubig, Graham and Sap, Maarten},\\n      journal={ICLR},\\n      year={2024},\\n      url={https://openreview.net/forum?id=mM7VurbA4r},\\n    }\\n\\n##  <::after> Getting Help \\n\\nFor more detailed information and advanced usage, see the official documentation at [ https://docs.sotopia.world/ ](https://docs.sotopia.world/)\\n\\n* * *\